<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>CFDI cancellation</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f8; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #1f2937;">
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f4f6f8; padding: 24px 0;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 32px 32px 16px 32px;">
                <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4; color: #111827;">CFDI cancellation</h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 32px 16px 32px;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
                  {{#if recipientName}}Dear {{recipientName}}{{else}}Dear customer{{/if}},
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
                  We inform you that the Comprobante Fiscal Digital por Internet (CFDI) associated with this transaction has been cancelled{{#if issuerName}} by {{issuerName}}{{/if}}.
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
                  Attached to this email you will find the document related to this cancellation for your records.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 8px 32px 24px 32px;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
                  We recommend keeping this document as evidence of the cancellation performed.
                </p>
                {{#if supportEmail}}
                  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    Should you need any further information, please contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;">{{supportEmail}}</a> and we will be glad to help.
                  </p>
                {{/if}}
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 16px 32px 32px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5;">
                  This message is automatically generated as a result of the CFDI cancellation{{#if issuerName}} by {{issuerName}}{{/if}}.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
